      duration: 'Weeks 3 to 6',
      description: "We implement the planning and execution loop, the step, time and spend budgets, checkpointing for long runs, and the approval interface your staff will use. Where a task splits naturally, we use a coordinating agent with specialised sub-agents, but only when that beats a single agent on the evaluation suite.",
    },
    {
      step: '04',
